   "source": [
    "## 1. Data Acquisition (Web Scraping)\n",
    "\n",
    "The site has 50 catalogue pages with 20 books each (1 000 books in total).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Step 1:** loop through all 50 listing pages and collect the **title, price, star rating and availability**\n",
    "of every book, plus the link to its own page.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Step 2:** open each book's own page to collect the **category (genre), exact stock quantity and description**.\n",
    "\n",
    "Tip: while testing, set `MAX_PAGES = 2` so it runs quickly. Set it to `50` for the final run."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "id": "d649891c",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Books collected from listing pages: 1000\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "MAX_PAGES = 50          # 50 = the whole site (1000 books). Use 2 for a quick test.\n",
    "base_url = \"https://books.toscrape.com/catalogue/\"\n",
    "\n",
    "books = []              # an empty list that will hold one dictionary per book\n",
    "\n",
    "for page in range(1, MAX_PAGES + 1):\n",
    "    url = base_url + \"page-\" + str(page) + \".html\"\n",
    "    response = requests.get(url)\n",
    "    response.encoding = \"utf-8\"                      # makes the pound sign read correctly\n",
    "    soup = BeautifulSoup(response.text, \"html.parser\")\n",
    "\n",
    "    # every book on the page sits inside <article class=\"product_pod\">\n",
    "    for item in soup.find_all(\"article\", class_=\"product_pod\"):\n",
    "        title = item.h3.a[\"title\"]\n",
    "        price = item.find(\"p\", class_=\"price_color\").text\n",
    "        rating = item.find(\"p\", class_=\"star-rating\")[\"class\"][1]      # e.g. \"Three\"\n",
    "        availability = item.find(\"p\", class_=\"instock availability\").text.strip()\n",
    "        link = base_url + item.h3.a[\"href\"]\n",
    "\n",
    "        books.append({\n",
    "            \"title\": title,\n",
    "            \"price\": price,\n",
    "            \"rating\": rating,\n",
    "            \"availability\": availability,\n",
    "            \"link\": link\n",
    "        })\n",
    "\n",
    "    time.sleep(0.2)                                  # small pause to be polite to the website\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Books collected from listing pages:\", len(books))"
   ]
  },
