    "### Evaluation\n",
    "- **MAE** - average size of the mistake in GBP (smaller is better)\n",
    "- **RMSE** - like MAE but punishes big mistakes more\n",
    "- **R-squared** - share of price variation the model explains (1 = perfect, 0 = no better than guessing the average)\n",
    "\n",
    "We also compare to a **baseline** that always predicts the average training price."
